{1}{[The Librarian looks up from the book she was reading] Oh hello there! Welcome to the Grayhills Public Library, how may I be of assistance?}{[The Librarian looks up from the book she was reading] Oh hello there! Welcome to the Grayhills Public Library, how may I be of assistance?}{}{}{}{}
