{260}{You’ll do it for me? That’s great! Well, the Bartender is over at ‘The Rathouse’. It’s on the north-west side of town, next to the docks. Just run over there and get my book back from him. Once you’ve done that, I’ll let you have ‘The Story of Amtut’. Oh, and you'll need to get a late fee of 50 coins from him too.}{You’ll do it for me? That’s great! Well, the Bartender is over at ‘The Rathouse’. It’s on the north-west side of town, next to the docks. Just run over there and get my book back from him. Once you’ve done that, I’ll let you have ‘The Story of Amtut’. Oh, and you'll need to get a late fee of 50 coins from him too.}{}{}{}{qu 1402 2}
