{2000}{You have met Amtut? Then the book is not merely a curiosity. Read its warning carefully: a heartstone must be with the person who kills him. Without it, death imprisons rather than releases.}{You have met Amtut? Then the book is not merely a curiosity. Read its warning carefully: a heartstone must be with the person who kills him. Without it, death imprisons rather than releases.}{}{}{}{}
