{2010}{A retired miner donated one to our mineral collection. Return All Guns Blazin' from the Rathouse first; then I can lend you the stone. You need not fight Amtut, but if he asks for release, do not go empty-handed.}{A retired miner donated one to our mineral collection. Return All Guns Blazin' from the Rathouse first; then I can lend you the stone. You need not fight Amtut, but if he asks for release, do not go empty-handed.}{}{}{}{}
