{2020}{Here. A heartstone, not some convenient substitute. Keep it in your own pack at the end. You may keep it afterward; there is no sense locking useful knowledge in a drawer.}{Here. A heartstone, not some convenient substitute. Keep it in your own pack at the end. You may keep it afterward; there is no sense locking useful knowledge in a drawer.}{}{}{}{}
